___ Answer Ron's question in README. Is there a continue option like we had with build_aomp.sh?
    No because we expect it never to fail and after a successful completion, developer
    only updates llvm-project and only rebuilds the compiler.
    Also TheRock does not use a serial ordering of component builds to maximize 
    parallel build. TheRock enforces component dependencies for proper ordering. 
    The only iteration is to amd-staging branch of llvm-project. 
    The README already explains the dev cycle: edit-build-install-test
